1
00:01:36,250 --> 00:01:40,050
[River of No Return]

2
00:01:40,170 --> 00:01:43,030
[Episode 5: Posing as a Performer]

3
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:46,810
Godfather!

4
00:01:47,090 --> 00:01:47,870
Useless fool!

5
00:01:47,870 --> 00:01:48,670
Useless fool!

6
00:01:50,729 --> 00:01:51,900
Send them all out.

7
00:01:52,420 --> 00:01:53,539
Search thoroughly!

8
00:01:53,539 --> 00:01:54,160
Yes!

9
00:01:54,479 --> 00:01:55,740
Front rank, follow me!

10
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:57,620
Rear rank,
search east along the riverbank!

11
00:01:57,620 --> 00:01:58,289
Yes!

12
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:02,340
Your Highness.

13
00:04:08,700 --> 00:04:09,560
Your Highness.

14
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,040
Come on.

15
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:40,210
Good-for-Nothing,

16
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:41,670
you've done
a great service by saving His Highness.

17
00:04:41,670 --> 00:04:43,050
When I'm before the throne later,

18
00:04:43,050 --> 00:04:44,510
I will report your service

19
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:45,580
to him truthfully.

20
00:04:47,010 --> 00:04:48,340
I really didn't expect this.

21
00:04:48,340 --> 00:04:49,380
Didn't expect what?

22
00:04:49,380 --> 00:04:50,780
You really didn't expect

23
00:04:51,670 --> 00:04:53,270
that we'd meet again, right?

24
00:04:53,730 --> 00:04:55,530
Yes. Here we are, meeting again.

25
00:04:56,300 --> 00:04:57,030
Come on, let's go.

26
00:04:57,030 --> 00:04:57,940
Hurry, run!

27
00:05:13,010 --> 00:05:13,460
Hurry.

28
00:05:16,390 --> 00:05:17,050
Wait.

29
00:05:22,820 --> 00:05:23,760
Come on, get on.

30
00:05:24,370 --> 00:05:25,380
Go check over there!

31
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:26,450
Hurry, you guys go.

32
00:05:26,470 --> 00:05:27,300
I'll lead them away.

33
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:27,760
Go!

34
00:05:27,780 --> 00:05:28,250
Okay.

35
00:05:34,690 --> 00:05:35,690
Stop right there!

36
00:05:36,690 --> 00:05:37,400
Stop!

37
00:05:42,950 --> 00:05:43,460
After them!

38
00:05:43,460 --> 00:05:44,100
Yes, sir!

39
00:05:52,460 --> 00:05:52,960
Stop!

40
00:05:55,370 --> 00:05:55,930
Officer,

41
00:05:56,340 --> 00:05:57,250
on night patrol?

42
00:05:57,250 --> 00:05:58,909
What are you doing out so late?

43
00:05:59,570 --> 00:06:00,170
Officer,

44
00:06:00,490 --> 00:06:02,340
old Mr. Sun, the blacksmith
in South City, is ill.

45
00:06:02,340 --> 00:06:02,810
I...

46
00:06:21,370 --> 00:06:22,760
I'll beat you to death!

47
00:06:37,170 --> 00:06:37,760
Let's go.

48
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:40,690
Hide the carriage and the bodies.

49
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:42,280
Hurry!

50
00:07:04,780 --> 00:07:06,510
The Brave Warriors Camp's men.

51
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:13,660
He was struck by a Swallowtail Arrow.

52
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:15,970
The barbed head has hooked into the flesh.

53
00:07:15,970 --> 00:07:17,570
We can't pull it out by force.

54
00:07:19,180 --> 00:07:20,980
We have to cut the shaft short first.

55
00:07:20,980 --> 00:07:23,780
Only then might we be able to
remove the arrowhead.

56
00:07:27,010 --> 00:07:28,800
His face has turned deathly pale.

57
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:30,260
He has lost too much blood.

58
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:34,590
But cutting the shaft would inevitably

59
00:07:34,590 --> 00:07:36,720
tug at the surrounding blood vessels.

60
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:45,770
Your Highness, don't fall asleep.

61
00:07:45,770 --> 00:07:48,330
I don't have
a single suitable medical instrument here.

62
00:07:48,330 --> 00:07:49,840
If we can't stop the bleeding,

63
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:50,640
I'm afraid...

64
00:07:51,159 --> 00:07:51,890
Dr. Su,

65
00:07:52,340 --> 00:07:53,220
I once read in

66
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,780
"The Essentials for Military Campaigns"

67
00:07:55,780 --> 00:07:56,950
that the garrison troops in Jinan

68
00:07:56,950 --> 00:07:58,510
used cauterization to stop bleeding.

69
00:07:58,510 --> 00:07:59,980
Perhaps we could try that method

70
00:07:59,980 --> 00:08:01,240
on His Highness first?

71
00:08:01,510 --> 00:08:02,410
Cauterization?

72
00:08:02,410 --> 00:08:02,920
Yes.

73
00:08:03,100 --> 00:08:03,840
Rectifier Yu.

74
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:04,900
Cauterization...

75
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,650
Cauterization.

76
00:08:06,650 --> 00:08:07,210
What?

77
00:08:07,540 --> 00:08:08,540
Hurry up and do it.

78
00:08:09,390 --> 00:08:10,680
Why so much talk?

79
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:12,740
-There must be a flatiron here.
-Do it.

80
00:08:12,740 --> 00:08:13,360
Flatiron.

81
00:08:13,770 --> 00:08:15,230
Quickly, find a flatiron!

82
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:17,160
Hurry up!

83
00:08:31,340 --> 00:08:33,270
You take it. You'll have to help me.

84
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,940
In a moment, when I cut the shaft,

85
00:08:34,940 --> 00:08:36,230
as soon as blood starts to seep out,

86
00:08:36,230 --> 00:08:37,250
use this flatiron

87
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:39,610
to cauterize the wound.

88
00:08:39,630 --> 00:08:40,360
Understand?

89
00:08:48,420 --> 00:08:49,220
Are you ready?

90
00:08:50,130 --> 00:08:50,930
Wait a minute.

91
00:08:51,770 --> 00:08:52,490
Do it.

92
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:55,490
Hurry up and do it.

93
00:08:55,610 --> 00:08:56,740
I'll count to three.

94
00:08:57,700 --> 00:08:58,490
Do it.

95
00:08:59,460 --> 00:09:00,040
One.

96
00:09:01,770 --> 00:09:02,370
Two.

97
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:03,770
Three.

98
00:09:07,940 --> 00:09:09,140
W-What are you doing?

99
00:09:09,150 --> 00:09:10,040
Do it!

100
00:09:10,590 --> 00:09:11,820
Do it! Hurry!

101
00:09:15,010 --> 00:09:16,030
He's the Crown Prince,
but he's still human.

102
00:09:16,030 --> 00:09:17,530
He'll die if he bleeds out!

103
00:09:17,770 --> 00:09:18,830
What are you doing?

104
00:09:18,870 --> 00:09:21,530
Are you just going to
stand there and let him die?

105
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:22,410
Do it!

106
00:09:29,420 --> 00:09:30,080
Old Mule,

107
00:09:30,780 --> 00:09:31,440
hold on.

108
00:09:32,990 --> 00:09:33,790
Hang in there.

109
00:09:34,230 --> 00:09:34,910
Press it.

110
00:10:26,180 --> 00:10:26,920
Dr. Su.

111
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:36,280
Roughly how long will

112
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:40,420
His Highness's arrow wound take to heal?

113
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:43,890
Twenty-odd days at the very least.

114
00:10:44,530 --> 00:10:45,530
Twenty-odd days?

115
00:10:46,010 --> 00:10:47,130
During that time,

116
00:10:47,510 --> 00:10:49,640
the patient can move around on his own.

117
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:52,930
But he needs oral medication,
external washing,

118
00:10:52,990 --> 00:10:54,540
and massage every day
without interruption.

119
00:10:54,540 --> 00:10:56,560
Otherwise, if the flesh heals improperly

120
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:58,360
and seals the arrowhead inside,

121
00:10:58,850 --> 00:11:01,050
the wound will have to be cut open again.

122
00:11:01,610 --> 00:11:02,960
And if the arrowhead

123
00:11:03,490 --> 00:11:04,530
is rusty

124
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,690
or has been coated with poison,

125
00:11:08,270 --> 00:11:10,000
all we can do is leave it to fate.

126
00:11:42,030 --> 00:11:43,160
Good-for-Nothing.

127
00:11:43,670 --> 00:11:46,860
[Fifth month, Gengchen day: The sovereign suffered from
an infirmity and summoned the Crown Prince back.]

128
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:47,090
I'm here to
get His Highness something to eat.

129
00:11:48,630 --> 00:11:49,560
Little Xingren.

130
00:11:50,350 --> 00:11:51,410
Take a look at this.

131
00:11:51,750 --> 00:11:52,410
Well...

132
00:11:53,490 --> 00:11:54,510
"The sovereign
suffered from an infirmity."

133
00:11:54,510 --> 00:11:55,510
What does it mean?

134
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:03,030
What does it mean?

135
00:12:04,610 --> 00:12:05,490
Nothing.

136
00:12:21,010 --> 00:12:21,770
Dr. Su.

137
00:12:24,150 --> 00:12:26,080
What does "infirmity" mean?

138
00:12:28,750 --> 00:12:29,320
What?

139
00:12:29,630 --> 00:12:30,290
Infirmity.

140
00:12:31,160 --> 00:12:32,280
Infertility...

141
00:12:32,890 --> 00:12:35,960
Well, the causes of infertility
are very complex.

142
00:12:36,330 --> 00:12:38,460
I can't explain them in a sentence or two.

143
00:12:38,460 --> 00:12:39,040
No.

144
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:41,680
"The sovereign
suffered from an infirmity."

145
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:43,210
There's also "sovereign."

146
00:12:44,540 --> 00:12:45,870
Where did you hear that?

147
00:12:47,350 --> 00:12:48,820
"Infirmity" means being ill,

148
00:12:48,820 --> 00:12:49,960
seriously ill.

149
00:12:50,410 --> 00:12:52,040
To the point of
being on the brink of death.

150
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:53,240
On the brink of death?

151
00:12:53,490 --> 00:12:56,150
And it means
the Emperor is on the brink of death.

152
00:12:56,530 --> 00:12:57,800
Why the Emperor?

153
00:12:59,130 --> 00:13:00,530
The sovereign suffered from an infirmity.

154
00:13:00,530 --> 00:13:02,300
"Sovereign" specifically
refers to the emperor,

155
00:13:02,300 --> 00:13:03,300
not to commoners.

156
00:13:31,150 --> 00:13:32,010
Your Highness.

157
00:13:33,130 --> 00:13:35,460
I found one of Good-for-Nothing's robes.

158
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:38,370
It seems to be in fairly good condition.

159
00:13:40,230 --> 00:13:41,320
He was probably

160
00:13:41,530 --> 00:13:43,280
saving it to wear on his wedding day.

161
00:13:43,280 --> 00:13:43,800
No need.

162
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:44,980
I can dress myself.

163
00:13:48,530 --> 00:13:49,410
Rectifier Yu.

164
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:51,330
Yes, Your Highness.

165
00:13:52,390 --> 00:13:54,050
Where did you find the doctor?

166
00:13:57,390 --> 00:13:58,250
Your Highness,

167
00:13:58,850 --> 00:13:59,490
the female doctor is...

168
00:13:59,490 --> 00:14:01,290
Your Highness the Crown Prince.

169
00:14:01,660 --> 00:14:03,660
Lord Yu can't answer that question.

170
00:14:03,770 --> 00:14:04,900
My name is Su Jingxi.

171
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:06,770
Yes.

172
00:14:14,370 --> 00:14:15,200
Dr. Su,

173
00:14:16,390 --> 00:14:17,800
then why did you save me?

174
00:14:18,750 --> 00:14:19,770
Because you and I

175
00:14:21,730 --> 00:14:22,960
share the same enemy.

176
00:14:25,730 --> 00:14:26,770
Zhu Buhua.

177
00:14:51,030 --> 00:14:53,090
He couldn't have done all this alone.

178
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:55,920
Someone must be helping him.

179
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:56,890
Zhu Wu.

180
00:14:57,370 --> 00:14:57,890
Yes.

181
00:14:58,610 --> 00:15:00,850
Send men to search the area
between here and Dinghuai Gate.

182
00:15:00,850 --> 00:15:02,250
Check every checkpoint set up

183
00:15:02,250 --> 00:15:03,630
by the Wardens' Offices of the Five Wards,

184
00:15:03,630 --> 00:15:04,800
one by one,

185
00:15:05,110 --> 00:15:07,010
and see if anyone has seen this carriage.

186
00:15:07,010 --> 00:15:07,530
Yes.

187
00:15:08,370 --> 00:15:08,910
Wait.

188
00:15:14,150 --> 00:15:14,920
Where are we?

189
00:15:15,410 --> 00:15:16,910
We just passed Changle Street.

190
00:15:16,910 --> 00:15:18,040
Up ahead is Tangfang Alley.

191
00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:20,840
And further in that direction
is Zhenhuai Street.

192
00:15:21,910 --> 00:15:23,130
Search every household.

193
00:15:23,130 --> 00:15:24,340
Don't leave a single one unchecked.

194
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:24,860
Yes.

195
00:15:25,300 --> 00:15:25,900
Follow me!

196
00:15:26,110 --> 00:15:26,680
Yes, sir!

197
00:15:34,040 --> 00:15:34,700
Eunuch Zhu.

198
00:15:35,350 --> 00:15:36,370
We've searched every household

199
00:15:36,370 --> 00:15:37,730
except one residence.

200
00:15:37,910 --> 00:15:39,170
No sign of the suspect.

201
00:15:39,370 --> 00:15:40,920
Except one residence?

202
00:15:41,300 --> 00:15:42,230
What do you mean?

203
00:15:42,890 --> 00:15:43,530
B-Because...

204
00:15:43,530 --> 00:15:46,390
That residence belongs to
Wu Buping, the Iron Lion.

205
00:15:48,650 --> 00:15:49,580
Why are you here?

206
00:15:50,180 --> 00:15:51,320
Hasn't your Iron Alliance

207
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:53,120
caused enough trouble already?

208
00:15:54,910 --> 00:15:56,560
Who cares if he's a lion or a leopard?

209
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:57,620
Search that place!

210
00:15:57,850 --> 00:15:58,350
Let's go!

211
00:15:58,350 --> 00:15:58,980
Yes, sir!

212
00:16:10,410 --> 00:16:11,070
Godfather.

213
00:16:24,660 --> 00:16:25,720
Who are you people?

214
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:27,270
You just barge in without even knocking?

215
00:16:27,270 --> 00:16:28,330
Search this place!

216
00:16:28,780 --> 00:16:29,560
Search every corner!

217
00:16:29,560 --> 00:16:30,620
Who are you people?

218
00:16:35,180 --> 00:16:36,410
Dr. Su?

219
00:16:38,730 --> 00:16:39,650
Eunuch Zhu.

220
00:16:56,130 --> 00:16:57,530
So he's Zhu Buhua.

221
00:17:02,790 --> 00:17:05,680
So you're Wu Dingyuan, Wu Buping's son?

222
00:17:06,500 --> 00:17:07,130
Yes, I am.

223
00:17:42,870 --> 00:17:43,530
Godfather.

224
00:17:43,870 --> 00:17:44,730
We found no one.

225
00:17:48,390 --> 00:17:49,200
Dr. Su,

226
00:17:50,590 --> 00:17:52,190
sorry to have disturbed you.

227
00:17:56,650 --> 00:17:57,180
Let's go!

228
00:17:58,100 --> 00:17:58,600
Hurry!

229
00:18:31,010 --> 00:18:32,070
What are you doing?

230
00:18:32,810 --> 00:18:34,410
Let go!

231
00:18:35,760 --> 00:18:37,920
Taking advantage of the situation, huh?

232
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:40,240
Dr. Su, that was quite a performance.

233
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:41,980
Why did you help us?

234
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:47,130
I was helping myself.

235
00:18:55,910 --> 00:18:56,740
I advise you

236
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:58,660
not to get any funny ideas.

237
00:18:58,740 --> 00:18:59,940
I'll be watching you.

238
00:19:04,420 --> 00:19:05,050
Come out.

239
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:07,560
They're gone.

240
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:21,760
Rectifier Yu.

241
00:19:23,420 --> 00:19:23,890
Yes, Your Highness.

242
00:19:23,890 --> 00:19:24,630
Rise.

243
00:19:25,810 --> 00:19:26,650
From now on,

244
00:19:26,850 --> 00:19:29,180
you need not observe palace formalities,

245
00:19:29,220 --> 00:19:30,760
lest it arouse suspicion.

246
00:19:32,630 --> 00:19:33,890
Go keep watch outside.

247
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:35,410
I'll rest for a while.

248
00:19:35,630 --> 00:19:37,200
We'll depart
as early as possible tomorrow.

249
00:19:37,200 --> 00:19:38,330
Yes, Your Highness.

250
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:47,650
I'm retiring for the night.

251
00:19:47,650 --> 00:19:49,050
You may all leave as well.

252
00:20:01,570 --> 00:20:03,000
Didn't you hear me?

253
00:20:03,500 --> 00:20:04,570
You may leave.

254
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:06,410
I'm going to bed.

255
00:20:09,810 --> 00:20:10,740
What do you mean?

256
00:20:11,410 --> 00:20:12,480
This is my house.

257
00:20:12,500 --> 00:20:13,900
Where am I supposed to go?

258
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:15,880
No, what are you doing?

259
00:20:16,650 --> 00:20:17,200
Go.

260
00:20:17,310 --> 00:20:17,870
Wait...

261
00:20:18,150 --> 00:20:19,810
No. Why are you indulging him?

262
00:20:20,590 --> 00:20:23,180
Just because he's royal,
he can do whatever he likes?

263
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:24,290
This is my home.

264
00:20:34,180 --> 00:20:35,310
Good-for-Nothing.

265
00:20:35,360 --> 00:20:35,890
Where are you going?

266
00:20:35,890 --> 00:20:37,850
Wherever I want.
It's none of your business.

267
00:20:37,850 --> 00:20:38,290
You...

268
00:20:38,650 --> 00:20:39,410
-You...
-What are you doing?

269
00:20:39,410 --> 00:20:41,220
-What are you doing?
-You can't leave!

270
00:20:41,220 --> 00:20:43,080
We can't afford any more trouble.

271
00:20:44,960 --> 00:20:47,000
Zhu Buhua has already been to my house.

272
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:48,570
What more trouble could there possibly be?

273
00:20:48,570 --> 00:20:49,830
Once your Crown Prince

274
00:20:50,310 --> 00:20:51,790
has rested enough at my house,

275
00:20:51,790 --> 00:20:53,590
hurry up and leave, understand?

276
00:20:53,790 --> 00:20:54,760
From now on,

277
00:20:55,550 --> 00:20:56,810
we go our separate ways

278
00:20:56,960 --> 00:20:58,490
and owe each other nothing.

279
00:20:58,540 --> 00:20:58,890
Wait.

280
00:20:58,890 --> 00:20:59,810
Give it back to me!

281
00:20:59,810 --> 00:21:00,370
Wait.

282
00:21:00,630 --> 00:21:01,090
Give it to me.

283
00:21:01,090 --> 00:21:03,790
The 2,000 taels of silver
you mentioned before...

284
00:21:03,790 --> 00:21:05,960
Don't you want to earn that money anymore?

285
00:21:05,960 --> 00:21:06,890
What do you mean?

286
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:10,610
How about we make a deal?

287
00:21:11,810 --> 00:21:14,290
You help me escort the Crown Prince

288
00:21:14,870 --> 00:21:16,070
safely back to Beijing...

289
00:21:16,070 --> 00:21:17,600
Let me stop you right there.

290
00:21:17,810 --> 00:21:18,480
Beijing?

291
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:21,060
Escort you all the way to Beijing?

292
00:21:21,160 --> 00:21:22,760
That job could get me killed.

293
00:21:23,090 --> 00:21:24,220
Two thousand taels?

294
00:21:24,570 --> 00:21:26,430
I wouldn't do it for 20,000 taels.

295
00:21:26,650 --> 00:21:27,130
You...

296
00:21:27,700 --> 00:21:28,650
It's not for you!

297
00:21:28,890 --> 00:21:30,160
It's for your father!

298
00:21:32,050 --> 00:21:32,980
Little Xingren.

299
00:21:33,940 --> 00:21:35,050
Stick to the point,

300
00:21:35,650 --> 00:21:37,710
and leave my papa out of this, hear me?

301
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:38,440
You...

302
00:21:38,460 --> 00:21:40,050
As the chief constable
of the Yingtian Prefectural Office,

303
00:21:40,050 --> 00:21:41,590
he's failed to solve
a single one of the several grave cases

304
00:21:41,590 --> 00:21:43,050
that arose in a single day.

305
00:21:47,670 --> 00:21:49,560
Do you think he can escape blame?

306
00:21:52,870 --> 00:21:54,550
Using my papa to pressure me, huh?

307
00:21:54,550 --> 00:21:57,210
It'd certainly be best
if he could escape blame.

308
00:21:58,910 --> 00:22:01,840
But if you can escort
the Crown Prince and earn merit,

309
00:22:01,870 --> 00:22:03,570
I'm sure someone as clever as you

310
00:22:03,570 --> 00:22:04,810
doesn't need me

311
00:22:05,440 --> 00:22:07,650
to spell out what's at stake.

312
00:22:39,050 --> 00:22:39,650
He Si!

313
00:22:40,130 --> 00:22:40,680
He Si!

314
00:22:42,180 --> 00:22:42,680
Envoy.

315
00:22:43,050 --> 00:22:43,540
What's wrong?

316
00:22:43,540 --> 00:22:44,580
Gather more men

317
00:22:44,850 --> 00:22:47,500
and come with me to Wu Buping's house
to catch Good-for-Nothing.

318
00:22:47,500 --> 00:22:48,960
Catch Good-for-Nothing?

319
00:22:49,020 --> 00:22:50,020
No need for that many.

320
00:22:50,020 --> 00:22:52,070
Just storm in
with his sister tied up as a hostage.

321
00:22:52,070 --> 00:22:52,910
We're going there to catch him,

322
00:22:52,910 --> 00:22:53,920
not rob the place.

323
00:22:54,630 --> 00:22:57,290
Good-for-Nothing isn't
as simple as you think.

324
00:22:57,390 --> 00:22:58,000
Envoy,

325
00:22:58,390 --> 00:23:00,650
after what happened at Xinghua Restaurant,
our men were scattered.

326
00:23:00,650 --> 00:23:02,240
Everyone is either in hiding or lying low.

327
00:23:02,240 --> 00:23:04,440
Where are we supposed to
find that many men?

328
00:23:04,440 --> 00:23:05,840
This isn't a discussion!

329
00:23:25,650 --> 00:23:26,240
Eunuch.

330
00:23:29,850 --> 00:23:32,380
Imperial Physician Li
requests an audience.

331
00:23:33,440 --> 00:23:34,440
Let him in.

332
00:23:41,660 --> 00:23:43,980
Eunuch Zhu,
Lord Zheng has regained consciousness.

333
00:23:43,980 --> 00:23:45,260
Although he is still somewhat confused,

334
00:23:45,260 --> 00:23:46,810
his physical injuries
are no longer serious.

335
00:23:46,810 --> 00:23:49,210
He can get out of bed
after a few days of rest.

336
00:23:54,740 --> 00:23:55,720
After he woke up,

337
00:23:55,810 --> 00:23:56,870
did he meet anyone?

338
00:23:56,940 --> 00:23:58,070
Did he say anything?

339
00:23:59,340 --> 00:23:59,970
Eunuch,

340
00:24:00,740 --> 00:24:02,850
h-he only asked me about something,

341
00:24:02,870 --> 00:24:04,310
a-and has seen no one else.

342
00:24:04,310 --> 00:24:05,170
What did he ask?

343
00:24:05,370 --> 00:24:08,440
Lord Zheng o-only asked me where he was

344
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:10,000
and how badly he was hurt.

345
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:12,330
I... answered him truthfully.

346
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:15,130
Did he ask you...

347
00:24:21,810 --> 00:24:22,480
Alright.

348
00:24:23,940 --> 00:24:24,890
You may leave.

349
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:27,390
Make sure Lord Zheng gets plenty of rest

350
00:24:27,390 --> 00:24:29,250
and don't let anyone disturb him.

351
00:24:30,070 --> 00:24:30,610
Leave.

352
00:24:30,910 --> 00:24:31,480
Yes.

353
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:38,860
Godfather,

354
00:24:39,160 --> 00:24:40,360
the entire city is now under curfew,

355
00:24:40,360 --> 00:24:41,920
and checkpoints are set up everywhere.

356
00:24:41,920 --> 00:24:43,920
However capable the Crown Prince may be,

357
00:24:43,920 --> 00:24:45,750
he can't leave Jinling.

358
00:24:54,180 --> 00:24:56,110
Speak if you have something to say.

359
00:25:00,180 --> 00:25:01,000
I...

360
00:25:02,180 --> 00:25:03,840
I won't go to Beijing with you.

361
00:25:04,590 --> 00:25:06,850
My father and sister are still here.

362
00:25:07,110 --> 00:25:09,290
Now that things
have gotten so out of hand,

363
00:25:09,290 --> 00:25:11,750
I'm afraid my papa
won't escape punishment.

364
00:25:11,990 --> 00:25:14,250
My sister still doesn't know any better,

365
00:25:14,810 --> 00:25:16,740
so I can't stop worrying about her.

366
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:18,700
Still, I want to thank you.

367
00:25:19,020 --> 00:25:20,080
At Xuanjin Bridge,

368
00:25:20,570 --> 00:25:21,570
you saved my life.

369
00:25:21,830 --> 00:25:23,760
I'll see you safely out of Jinling.

370
00:25:23,960 --> 00:25:26,160
That's a promise I will certainly keep.

371
00:25:29,310 --> 00:25:33,290
Don't you want to seize this opportunity
to make something of yourself?

372
00:25:33,290 --> 00:25:34,410
I'm

373
00:25:35,050 --> 00:25:36,650
not cut out to be an official.

374
00:25:36,660 --> 00:25:38,240
I'm quite content to remain

375
00:25:38,830 --> 00:25:40,160
an ordinary constable.

376
00:25:50,760 --> 00:25:51,940
Don't let that weigh on your mind.

377
00:25:51,940 --> 00:25:53,940
It's just an "infirmity," isn't it?

378
00:25:55,050 --> 00:25:56,410
I asked the two of them about it.

379
00:25:56,410 --> 00:25:58,700
But I don't think
they are necessarily right.

380
00:25:58,700 --> 00:26:01,090
"Infirmity" just means being sick, right?

381
00:26:01,090 --> 00:26:03,890
And if it's a sickness,
it can definitely be cured.

382
00:26:09,370 --> 00:26:09,890
Okay.

383
00:26:12,810 --> 00:26:13,890
I'm rather tired.

384
00:26:14,390 --> 00:26:15,390
You may leave now.

385
00:26:23,920 --> 00:26:24,890
Actually...

386
00:26:26,160 --> 00:26:27,570
I worry about my papa too.

387
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:31,240
I've always been at odds with him.

388
00:26:32,260 --> 00:26:33,990
I'm really afraid that one day,

389
00:26:34,570 --> 00:26:36,830
if something terrible happens to him...

390
00:26:38,210 --> 00:26:40,870
I won't have anyone to butt heads with.

391
00:26:43,420 --> 00:26:44,130
Papa...

392
00:26:46,760 --> 00:26:47,960
That word

393
00:26:49,660 --> 00:26:50,920
sounds so far away.

394
00:26:51,830 --> 00:26:53,560
I haven't called my father that

395
00:26:53,660 --> 00:26:54,960
in a very long time.

396
00:26:55,790 --> 00:26:57,630
All day it's the Ministry of Rites this,
the Ministry of Rites that.

397
00:26:57,630 --> 00:26:59,830
Is the Ministry of Rites heaven itself?

398
00:27:07,290 --> 00:27:09,160
My respects, Father.

399
00:27:10,610 --> 00:27:11,440
Rise.

400
00:27:15,740 --> 00:27:18,160
Ever since your grandfather passed away,

401
00:27:18,530 --> 00:27:20,660
you've been opposing me at every turn.

402
00:27:20,680 --> 00:27:21,410
I have not.

403
00:27:21,550 --> 00:27:22,550
Still denying it?

404
00:27:24,460 --> 00:27:25,390
As your subject,

405
00:27:25,520 --> 00:27:26,920
it's my duty to offer remonstrance.

406
00:27:26,920 --> 00:27:28,330
But as your son, I ought even more to...

407
00:27:28,330 --> 00:27:29,370
Ought to what?

408
00:27:29,810 --> 00:27:32,370
Every time you open your mouth,

409
00:27:32,740 --> 00:27:35,000
it's either state affairs or politics.

410
00:27:35,480 --> 00:27:36,370
Let me tell you,

411
00:27:37,740 --> 00:27:39,000
a father is a father,

412
00:27:39,420 --> 00:27:40,720
and a son is a son.

413
00:27:41,130 --> 00:27:42,330
Between the two of us,

414
00:27:42,440 --> 00:27:43,810
we are father and son first,

415
00:27:43,810 --> 00:27:44,660
ruler and subject second...

416
00:27:44,660 --> 00:27:46,570
But you never let me
finish a single sentence.

417
00:27:46,570 --> 00:27:48,420
You made me Crown Prince
and let me oversee state affairs!

418
00:27:48,420 --> 00:27:49,570
But whenever something important comes up,

419
00:27:49,570 --> 00:27:50,740
you take matters into your own hands!

420
00:27:50,740 --> 00:27:52,240
But I am the Emperor.

421
00:27:52,260 --> 00:27:53,180
So what if you are the Emperor?

422
00:27:53,180 --> 00:27:54,150
Aren't emperors human?

423
00:27:54,150 --> 00:27:55,610
You just treat me as a pawn!

424
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:57,090
So what if you're a pawn?

425
00:27:58,480 --> 00:27:59,520
I don't trust

426
00:27:59,920 --> 00:28:02,090
anyone in this Beijing palace,

427
00:28:03,760 --> 00:28:04,760
including you.

428
00:28:08,310 --> 00:28:09,570
I finally understand.

429
00:28:09,920 --> 00:28:11,450
So in Your Majesty's heart,

430
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:14,210
I'm no different from the rest.

431
00:28:15,810 --> 00:28:16,570
Son,

432
00:28:17,150 --> 00:28:19,370
sooner or later you'll be Emperor too.

433
00:28:20,050 --> 00:28:23,580
And you, too, will have
a Crown Prince and a Crown Prince's heir.

434
00:28:26,220 --> 00:28:27,240
Go to Jinling.

435
00:28:28,410 --> 00:28:30,760
Stay far away from your old man.

436
00:28:32,720 --> 00:28:34,810
From now on, make your own decisions.

437
00:28:34,830 --> 00:28:35,650
I understand.

438
00:28:39,390 --> 00:28:40,650
If you don't call him Papa,

439
00:28:40,650 --> 00:28:42,250
what do you call your father?

440
00:28:45,810 --> 00:28:46,810
What do I call him?

441
00:28:47,830 --> 00:28:49,890
"Emperor," "Your Majesty."

442
00:28:51,760 --> 00:28:54,200
Yesterday, I was still
dressed in my royal robes.

443
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:54,920
Today,

444
00:28:55,510 --> 00:28:56,380
I'm being

445
00:28:56,410 --> 00:28:58,090
hounded like a stray dog.

446
00:28:59,810 --> 00:29:00,480
Tell me...

447
00:29:03,660 --> 00:29:05,320
who would care about all this?

448
00:29:05,650 --> 00:29:07,050
Of course someone cares.

449
00:29:07,220 --> 00:29:09,200
Papa... Father...

450
00:29:10,630 --> 00:29:12,260
Whatever you call him, it doesn't matter.

451
00:29:12,260 --> 00:29:12,890
Anyway,

452
00:29:13,180 --> 00:29:13,650
a father

453
00:29:14,130 --> 00:29:15,570
is the only person in this world

454
00:29:15,570 --> 00:29:18,230
who genuinely wishes for
his son to surpass him.

455
00:29:20,130 --> 00:29:21,330
By that logic,

456
00:29:21,940 --> 00:29:23,940
wouldn't a mother feel the same way?

457
00:29:25,650 --> 00:29:28,000
A mother... should be the same.

458
00:29:29,050 --> 00:29:30,450
But I don't have a mother.

459
00:29:35,110 --> 00:29:35,890
Perhaps I do.

460
00:29:37,110 --> 00:29:38,570
But I don't know who she is.

461
00:29:49,830 --> 00:29:51,630
Your father is a good constable.

462
00:29:54,390 --> 00:29:56,050
I'll issue an imperial pardon

463
00:29:57,760 --> 00:29:59,560
to keep your entire family safe.

464
00:30:02,460 --> 00:30:03,090
Thank you.

465
00:30:43,420 --> 00:30:44,090
Open it.

466
00:30:47,370 --> 00:30:50,830
This is from a case my father investigated
a couple of days ago.

467
00:30:51,520 --> 00:30:54,720
A variety-play performer
in the entertainment district

468
00:30:54,870 --> 00:30:56,760
lured and violated a female spectator.

469
00:30:56,760 --> 00:30:57,370
These are

470
00:30:57,500 --> 00:30:59,610
all pieces of evidence found at the scene.

471
00:30:59,610 --> 00:31:01,420
They haven't been handed over
to the prefectural office yet.

472
00:31:01,420 --> 00:31:02,880
They'll come in handy now.

473
00:31:06,310 --> 00:31:07,480
How exactly?

474
00:31:08,160 --> 00:31:08,810
Me.

475
00:31:10,040 --> 00:31:12,460
Aren't I a constable
of the Yingtian Prefectural Office?

476
00:31:12,460 --> 00:31:14,970
I escort criminals
to the prefectural office to face justice.

477
00:31:14,970 --> 00:31:16,820
It's absolutely foolproof.

478
00:31:17,350 --> 00:31:18,590
No matter how they question us,

479
00:31:18,590 --> 00:31:20,190
there won't be a single flaw.

480
00:31:23,500 --> 00:31:24,760
He is the Crown Prince.

481
00:31:25,290 --> 00:31:27,690
How can he disguise himself
as a performer?

482
00:31:28,750 --> 00:31:32,230
You're not trying to
make a fool of him, are you?

483
00:31:32,500 --> 00:31:34,200
Then you play the lecherous criminal.

484
00:31:34,200 --> 00:31:35,710
But he must play

485
00:31:35,740 --> 00:31:37,160
the cuckolded husband.

486
00:31:37,790 --> 00:31:39,250
This absolutely won't do!

487
00:31:39,470 --> 00:31:41,250
Well, what's wrong with it?

488
00:31:43,250 --> 00:31:45,550
When he wears his royal robes,
he's the Crown Prince.

489
00:31:45,550 --> 00:31:47,010
But once he takes them off,

490
00:31:47,160 --> 00:31:49,560
isn't he just a stray dog
with no power left?

491
00:31:50,050 --> 00:31:50,940
Good-for-Nothing,

492
00:31:50,940 --> 00:31:52,740
you are outrageously insolent!

493
00:31:53,720 --> 00:31:54,840
Mocking His Highness

494
00:31:54,840 --> 00:31:56,240
will cost you your head!

495
00:31:57,410 --> 00:31:58,570
Don't put words in my mouth.

496
00:31:58,570 --> 00:31:59,850
I didn't say that.

497
00:32:00,220 --> 00:32:01,310
He said it himself.

498
00:32:01,330 --> 00:32:03,130
Go ask him if you don't believe me.

499
00:32:03,130 --> 00:32:04,590
Don't accuse me unfairly.

500
00:32:14,330 --> 00:32:15,960
"The aforementioned performer

501
00:32:15,960 --> 00:32:18,240
defiled a relative of Lord Yu Qian,

502
00:32:18,590 --> 00:32:20,650
Director of the Messenger's Office,

503
00:32:21,050 --> 00:32:23,310
and was caught in bed by Lord Yu himself."

504
00:32:23,830 --> 00:32:24,760
Give that to me. Let me see.

505
00:32:24,760 --> 00:32:26,090
Look for yourself then.

506
00:32:26,570 --> 00:32:29,050
"Out of regard
for the honor of the official's relative,

507
00:32:29,050 --> 00:32:32,380
special permission has been granted
to expedite the case."

508
00:32:39,890 --> 00:32:41,520
Isn't there another way?

509
00:32:43,290 --> 00:32:45,110
Like a bridegroom falling into a cesspit.

510
00:32:45,110 --> 00:32:47,520
Which matters more—
your pride or your life?

511
00:32:47,520 --> 00:32:49,320
I never imagined that I, Yu Qian,

512
00:32:50,070 --> 00:32:52,050
would be made such a fool by you.

513
00:32:55,350 --> 00:32:56,680
There's no time to lose.

514
00:32:57,290 --> 00:32:59,160
Hurry, disguise the Crown Prince.

515
00:32:59,160 --> 00:33:00,000
How?

516
00:33:01,000 --> 00:33:02,460
Just work it out yourself.

517
00:33:07,920 --> 00:33:08,850
Your Highness,

518
00:33:09,390 --> 00:33:11,990
please take extra care of
your wound on the way.

519
00:33:12,000 --> 00:33:13,260
I'll take my leave now.

520
00:33:20,440 --> 00:33:21,970
Dr. Su, where are you going?

521
00:33:22,630 --> 00:33:23,200
I...

522
00:33:23,680 --> 00:33:24,240
Go back.

523
00:33:24,940 --> 00:33:25,390
-What are you doing?
-Go back!

524
00:33:25,390 --> 00:33:26,450
What are you doing?

525
00:33:27,240 --> 00:33:29,640
Now that you know His Highness's identity,

526
00:33:29,700 --> 00:33:31,090
we can't let you go.

527
00:33:32,610 --> 00:33:34,670
You must return to the capital with us

528
00:33:34,980 --> 00:33:38,440
so you can treat His Highness's injuries
whenever necessary.

529
00:33:38,970 --> 00:33:40,430
As long as Zhu Buhua lives,

530
00:33:40,960 --> 00:33:42,290
I'm not going anywhere.

531
00:33:43,260 --> 00:33:44,310
Then I'll tie you up

532
00:33:44,310 --> 00:33:46,240
-and take you!
-What are you doing?

533
00:33:47,630 --> 00:33:49,560
Dr. Su, you're an educated person.

534
00:33:49,720 --> 00:33:51,450
Now the whole city is our enemy.

535
00:33:52,130 --> 00:33:53,260
When the nest falls,

536
00:33:53,410 --> 00:33:54,940
can anything remain whole?

537
00:33:55,610 --> 00:33:56,540
Little Xingren,

538
00:33:57,180 --> 00:33:58,650
you're educated too.

539
00:33:58,830 --> 00:34:00,290
Can you be a bit more refined?

540
00:34:00,290 --> 00:34:02,200
Must you keep going on about holes?

541
00:34:02,200 --> 00:34:04,060
Dr. Su doesn't like hearing that.

542
00:34:04,270 --> 00:34:04,850
You...

543
00:34:06,570 --> 00:34:07,900
You good-for-nothing.

544
00:34:08,920 --> 00:34:10,520
You're not allowed to leave!

545
00:34:41,350 --> 00:34:42,080
Dr. Su.

546
00:34:46,679 --> 00:34:49,139
I'm indebted to you for treating my wound.

547
00:34:50,489 --> 00:34:52,090
Once I return to the capital,

548
00:34:52,219 --> 00:34:54,679
I shall make sure
you are properly rewarded.

549
00:34:56,330 --> 00:34:57,520
If you're unwilling

550
00:34:57,960 --> 00:34:59,640
to go to the capital with me,

551
00:35:00,080 --> 00:35:01,610
then we will part ways here.

552
00:35:05,600 --> 00:35:06,400
Rest assured.

553
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:08,080
If one day

554
00:35:09,350 --> 00:35:11,750
I successfully
make it back to the capital,

555
00:35:11,810 --> 00:35:12,960
I will never

556
00:35:14,500 --> 00:35:15,810
spare Zhu Buhua.

557
00:35:18,770 --> 00:35:19,810
Y-Your Highness.

558
00:35:20,230 --> 00:35:22,430
Your Highness mustn't speak so rashly.

559
00:35:23,040 --> 00:35:25,240
Your arrow wound is still very serious.

560
00:35:25,410 --> 00:35:28,070
And right now,
there's no one else we can rely on.

561
00:35:28,230 --> 00:35:29,090
Your Highness.

562
00:35:30,670 --> 00:35:31,520
Then I

563
00:35:32,290 --> 00:35:34,220
will accompany you to the capital.

564
00:35:54,230 --> 00:35:56,830
I, Zhu Zhanji,
swear upon this incense burner:

565
00:35:59,290 --> 00:36:00,890
I shall return to the capital

566
00:36:01,890 --> 00:36:04,020
and capture the villain responsible.

567
00:36:05,540 --> 00:36:07,740
No matter how many hardships lie ahead,

568
00:36:09,230 --> 00:36:10,920
I shall never give up.

569
00:36:13,690 --> 00:36:15,490
May gods and men be my witnesses.

570
00:36:39,730 --> 00:36:40,860
Good-for-Nothing.

571
00:36:42,770 --> 00:36:45,900
This is the sacred vessel
His Highness used for his oath.

572
00:36:46,980 --> 00:36:48,840
It must not be discarded lightly.

573
00:36:49,390 --> 00:36:50,600
Can you give it to me?

574
00:36:50,980 --> 00:36:51,850
Give it to you?

575
00:36:53,000 --> 00:36:53,850
No way.

576
00:36:54,600 --> 00:36:55,730
This incense burner

577
00:36:55,810 --> 00:36:57,890
is a birthday gift I gave my sister.

578
00:36:58,660 --> 00:37:00,520
I never intended to throw it away.

579
00:37:03,520 --> 00:37:04,380
How about this?

580
00:37:04,580 --> 00:37:05,640
I'll lend it to you.

581
00:37:05,890 --> 00:37:07,330
But once you leave Jinling,

582
00:37:07,330 --> 00:37:08,850
you have to give it back to me.

583
00:37:08,850 --> 00:37:09,600
Then

584
00:37:10,210 --> 00:37:12,410
we'll settle
old and new accounts together.

585
00:37:12,410 --> 00:37:13,940
You know what I mean, right?

586
00:37:15,920 --> 00:37:16,850
Enough talking.

587
00:37:17,270 --> 00:37:17,890
Let's go.

588
00:37:43,000 --> 00:37:44,370
Did you hear the crying?

589
00:37:45,770 --> 00:37:46,770
I'm not deaf.

590
00:37:47,980 --> 00:37:48,910
Don't look back.

591
00:37:49,120 --> 00:37:50,040
Who's crying?

592
00:37:52,080 --> 00:37:54,340
Probably people from these households.

593
00:37:56,520 --> 00:37:57,650
Why are they crying?

594
00:38:00,420 --> 00:38:01,330
This alley

595
00:38:02,080 --> 00:38:03,410
is called Zongbo Alley.

596
00:38:03,600 --> 00:38:06,480
The Minister, Vice Minister,
Directors, Vice Directors,

597
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:09,870
and other senior officials
of the Ministry of Rites all live here,

598
00:38:09,870 --> 00:38:10,920
hence the name.

599
00:38:11,910 --> 00:38:14,110
When Your Highness arrived in Jinling,

600
00:38:14,270 --> 00:38:17,370
the officials who came to
welcome you at the Dongshuiguan Wharf

601
00:38:17,370 --> 00:38:19,230
were led by the Ministry of Rites.

602
00:38:19,750 --> 00:38:21,880
So when the treasure ship was blown up,

603
00:38:22,420 --> 00:38:25,620
the Ministry of Rites
suffered the heaviest casualties.

604
00:38:26,210 --> 00:38:28,140
I'm afraid almost every household

605
00:38:29,600 --> 00:38:31,860
in Zongbo Alley is probably in mourning,

606
00:38:32,230 --> 00:38:34,690
with funeral banners
hanging at every door.

607
00:39:11,730 --> 00:39:12,920
I'm too late again.

608
00:39:14,320 --> 00:39:16,180
That darned Zhu Buhua

609
00:39:17,190 --> 00:39:19,050
only knows how to alert the enemy.

610
00:39:21,580 --> 00:39:22,210
Envoy!

611
00:39:23,100 --> 00:39:23,730
Envoy!

612
00:39:43,730 --> 00:39:44,290
Envoy...

613
00:39:45,850 --> 00:39:46,410
Envoy!

614
00:40:00,060 --> 00:40:03,190
Do you still get headaches
when you see the Crown Prince?

615
00:40:04,350 --> 00:40:05,890
It's not exactly a headache.

616
00:40:05,890 --> 00:40:08,210
I can't quite describe the feeling.

617
00:40:09,060 --> 00:40:10,000
It's almost

618
00:40:10,520 --> 00:40:12,080
as if there's some kind of vision

619
00:40:12,080 --> 00:40:14,040
that I just can't get out of my head.

620
00:40:14,680 --> 00:40:17,010
Is the vision related to the Crown Prince?

621
00:40:20,080 --> 00:40:21,140
How should I put it?

622
00:40:21,290 --> 00:40:22,440
Think carefully.

623
00:40:23,230 --> 00:40:24,830
You must've seen him before.

624
00:40:25,020 --> 00:40:26,790
Where would someone like me have

625
00:40:26,790 --> 00:40:28,520
ever had the chance to meet him?

626
00:40:29,830 --> 00:40:31,440
But then again,

627
00:40:31,790 --> 00:40:33,720
the more I try to stay away from him,

628
00:40:33,810 --> 00:40:35,720
the harder it becomes to shake him off.

629
00:40:35,720 --> 00:40:36,470
What a curse.

630
00:40:54,580 --> 00:40:55,250
Iron Lion!

631
00:40:56,600 --> 00:40:57,290
Envoy.

632
00:40:59,620 --> 00:41:00,330
Papa!

633
00:41:06,810 --> 00:41:07,370
Papa.

634
00:41:07,650 --> 00:41:08,910
Alright, alright now.

635
00:41:14,620 --> 00:41:16,020
How did you get the wound?

636
00:41:17,250 --> 00:41:17,890
Yulu.

637
00:41:18,640 --> 00:41:19,840
You can go back first.

638
00:41:21,250 --> 00:41:22,380
It's okay. Go ahead.

639
00:41:23,810 --> 00:41:25,120
I'll come find you later.

640
00:41:25,120 --> 00:41:25,690
Go.

641
00:41:26,370 --> 00:41:26,920
Go.

642
00:41:28,140 --> 00:41:28,730
Go.

643
00:41:29,980 --> 00:41:30,480
Go.

644
00:41:35,480 --> 00:41:36,880
Not even a word of thanks.

645
00:41:37,020 --> 00:41:38,380
Thank you, Envoy.

646
00:41:40,310 --> 00:41:42,370
Yulu has been with me, so don't worry.

647
00:41:43,600 --> 00:41:44,520
But...

648
00:41:45,480 --> 00:41:48,210
while you were on night duty, your son

649
00:41:48,460 --> 00:41:50,690
brought a girl to bed and fooled around.

650
00:41:57,830 --> 00:41:58,920
It seems...

651
00:42:04,980 --> 00:42:07,510
He's not the one
we're looking for, after all.

652
00:42:07,690 --> 00:42:09,600
Exactly, Envoy. Exactly.

653
00:42:16,120 --> 00:42:16,780
Go back now.

654
00:42:17,040 --> 00:42:18,040
Thank you, Envoy.

655
00:42:23,080 --> 00:42:24,080
Keep an eye on them

656
00:42:24,560 --> 00:42:26,160
and see where they are going.

657
00:42:26,770 --> 00:42:27,500
Understood.

658
00:42:31,910 --> 00:42:32,520
Papa.

659
00:42:33,080 --> 00:42:35,370
What exactly do they want with my brother?

660
00:42:35,370 --> 00:42:36,830
They got the wrong person.

661
00:42:38,920 --> 00:42:40,770
But while they were holding me,

662
00:42:40,960 --> 00:42:43,560
they kept asking about
Dingyuan's childhood.

663
00:42:43,910 --> 00:42:45,170
What did you tell them?

664
00:42:45,790 --> 00:42:47,850
How would I know about his childhood?

665
00:42:48,020 --> 00:42:50,020
I only remember he was in poor health

666
00:42:50,020 --> 00:42:51,420
and often had headaches,

667
00:42:51,770 --> 00:42:54,000
and you kept finding doctors for him.

668
00:42:54,560 --> 00:42:57,220
He doesn't even remember much about it himself.

669
00:42:57,370 --> 00:42:58,750
Why did you tell them all that?

670
00:42:58,750 --> 00:43:00,410
-I...
-Why did you say so much?

671
00:43:00,690 --> 00:43:02,490
Am I not allowed to say anything?

672
00:43:02,920 --> 00:43:03,690
Forget it.

673
00:43:03,910 --> 00:43:05,170
We'll go find him right now.

674
00:43:05,170 --> 00:43:06,560
Find him, and then we'll leave Jinling.

675
00:43:06,560 --> 00:43:07,350
Come on, let's go.

676
00:43:07,350 --> 00:43:08,410
I'm not leaving!

677
00:43:08,730 --> 00:43:09,710
Explain it to me clearly first.
